      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so if we were to look at the management side of things, would you say that because of these \"cultural\" differences in discipline, we'd need to implement much more aggressive oversight and different types of supervision in those African plants compared to, say, a plant in Eastern Europe? basically, how much more \"control\" is required for that specific demographic to ensure they actually hit their KPIs?",
